evV = new int[N];\n                int[] prevE = new int[N];\n                int[] maxF = new int[N];\n                Arrays.fill(dist, INF);\n                Arrays.fill(prevV, -1);\n                Arrays.fill(prevE, -1);\n\n                dist[S] = 0;\n                maxF[S] = Integer.MAX_VALUE;\n                PriorityQueue<int[]> pq = new PriorityQueue<>(Comparator.comparingInt(a -> a[0]));\n                pq.add(new int[]{0, S});\n\n                while (!pq.isEmpty()) {\n                    int[] cur = pq.poll();\n                    int d = cur[0];\n                    int v = cur[1];\n                    if (d != dist[v]) continue;\n\n                    for (int i = 0; i < g.get(v).size(); i++) {\n                        Edge e = g.get(v).get(i);\n                        if (e.cap <= 0) continue;\n                        int nd = d + e.cost;\n                        if (nd < dist[e.to]) {\n                            dist[e.to] = nd;\n                            prevV[e.to] = v;\n                            prevE[e.to] = i;\n                            maxF[e.to] = Math.min(maxF[v], e.cap);\n                            pq.add(new int[]{nd, e.to});\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n\n                if (dist[T] == INF) break;\n\n                int add = maxF[T];\n                for (int v = T; v != S; v = prevV[v]) {\n                    Edge e = g.get(prevV[v]).get(prevE[v]);\n                    totalCost += add * e.orig;\n                    e.cap -= add;\n                    g.get(v).get(e.rev).cap += add;\n                }\n                flow += add;\n\n                for (int v = 0; v < N; v++) {\n                    if (dist[v] == INF) continue;\n                    for (Edge e : g.get(v)) {\n                        if (dist[e.to] != INF) {\n                            e.cost += dist[v] - dist[e.to];\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            return new Pair(flow, totalCost);\n        }\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {\n        BufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\n        StringTokenizer st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n        int n = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        int m = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        int K = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        int c = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        int d = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n\n        int[] start = new int[K];\n        st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n        for (int i = 0; i < K; i++) {\n            start[i] = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n        }\n\n        ArrayList<ArrayList<Integer>> adj = new ArrayList<>(n + 1);\n        for (int i = 0; i <= n; i++) {\n            adj.add(new ArrayList<>());\n        }\n        for (int i = 0; i < m; i++) {\n            st = new StringTokenizer(br.readLine());\n            int x = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n            int y = Integer.parseInt(st.nextToken());\n            adj.get(x).add(y);\n            adj.get(y).add(x);\n        }\n\n        final int maxTime = 120;\n        java.util.function.BiFunction<Integer, Integer, Integer> id = (t, j) -> t * n + (j - 1);\n\n        int S = maxTime * n;\n        int T = S + 1;\n        MCMF mf = new MCMF(maxTime * n + 2, S, T);\n\n        for (int i = 0; i < K; i++) {\n            mf.addEdge(S, id.apply(0, start[i]), 1, 0);\n        }\n\n        for (int t = 0; t < maxTime; t++) {\n            mf.addEdge(id.apply(t, 1), T, K, c * t);\n        }\n\n        for (int t = 0; t < maxTime - 1; t++) {\n            for (int j = 1; j <= n; j++) {\n                for (int nb : adj.get(j)) {\n                    for (int z = 1; z <= 105; z += 2) {\n                        mf.addEdge(id.apply(t, j), id.apply(t + 1, nb), 1, d * z);\n                    }\n                }\n                mf.addEdge(id.apply(t, j), id.apply(t + 1,